OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of planning terror
OL,4,Aattack during Trump visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been accused of planning a
OL,7,Fterror attack with a knife during US
OL,8,Fpresident Donald Trump's visit to
OL,9,FScotland last summer.
OL,11,FAbhay Devdas Nayak, 42, is accused of
OL,12,Ftravelling from his home in Luton with
OL,13,Fthe intention of purchasing a knife on
OL,14,Fhis arrival and committing an "act of
OL,15,Fterrorism" against supporters of the US
OL,16,Fleader.
OL,18,FProsecutors also allege Nayak made
OL,19,Farrangements in 2025 to travel to
OL,20,FTurkey with the intention of going to
OL,21,FSyria and engaging with the Islamic
OL,22,FState terror group.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
