OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of planning terror
OL,4,Aattack during Trump visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FNayak, who denies the charges, was
OL,7,Farrested and charged after a
OL,8,Fdisturbance on a flight from Luton to
OL,9,FGlasgow Airport last July.
